Line@1:1 -- Every literal form, all well-formed.
Line@2:1 -- Decimal integers, with underscores and exponents.
Line@4:1 -- Decimal reals.
Line@6:1 -- Based literals: integer and real, with exponents and underscores.
Line@8:1 -- Physical literals are an abstract literal followed by a unit name.
Line@10:1 -- Character literals, including the delimiters themselves.
Line@12:1 -- String literals; doubled quotes, and the percent replacement.
Line@14:1 -- Bit-string literals: bases, signedness, length prefixes, both delimiters.
